Reread the religion spoilers. If you're looking for goodies as in 
"artifacts" you don't want to pray. In order to get artifacts you must 
sacrifice when you are *able* to pray successfully. If you pray you 
won't be able to pray again for a while. You can't get artifacts by 
sacrificing during that time.


